的素材 </button></view><text class="hint">至少选择 1 张；顺序对应方案中的图片编号。模型最多支持 {{H}} 张。</text></view><image-library wx:if="{{L}}" key="{{I}}" bindclose="{{J}}" bindselect="{{K}}" u-i="283b8dc0-2,283b8dc0-0" bind:__l="__l" u-p="{{L}}"/><view class="card"><view class="heading"><text>创作方向</text><button class="link" bindtap="{{M}}">不限定</button></view><scroll-view scroll-x class="direction-rail"><view class="direction-list"><button wx:for="{{N}}" wx:for-item="direction" wx:key="e" class="{{['direction',direction.f&&'selected']}}" bindtap="{{direction.g}}"><image wx:if="{{direction.a}}" src="{{direction.b}}" mode="aspectFill"/><text>{{direction.c}}{{direction.d}}</text></button></view></scroll-view><block wx:if="{{O}}"><text class="hint">{{P}}</text><video wx:if="{{Q}}" src="{{R}}" class="work-video" autoplay="{{false}}" controls/></block><text wx:if="{{S}}" class="muted">暂无预设方向，可直接填写创作要求。</text></view><view class="card"><view class="heading"><text>创作要求</text></view><view class="row"><button class="{{[T&&'selected']}}" bindtap="{{U}}"> 一句话主题</button><button class="{{[V&&'selected']}}" bindtap="{{W}}"> 遵循提示词 </button></view><label wx:if="{{X}}"><text class="field-label">主题</text><block wx:if="{{r0}}"><textarea class="resize-none" maxlength="{{2000}}" cursor-spacing="{{120}}" adjust-position="{{true}}" placeholder="例如：用三张产品图，拍一支自然光下的新品介绍短片" value="{{Y}}" bindinput="{{Z}}"/></block></label><label wx:else><text class="field-label">完整提示词</text><block wx:if="{{r0}}"><textarea class="prompt-field resize-none" maxlength="{{12000}}" cursor-spacing="{{120}}" adjust-position="{{true}}" placeholder="描述人物、场景、镜头与动作；方案会保留你的创作意图" value="{{aa}}" bindinput="{{ab}}"/></block></label><button class="link" disabled="{{ad}}" bindtap="{{ae}}">{{ac}}</button><text class="hint">智能撰写和方案分析的积分以当前报价为准。主题和提示词分别保留，切换不丢内容。</text></view><view wx:if="{{af}}" class="error">{{ag}}<button class="link" disabled="{{ah}}" bindtap="{{ai}}"> 重新估价 </button></view><view wx:if="{{aj}}" class="error" role="alert">{{ak}}</view><t